      "comment": "WATCH AFRICANDANCE (5) looks close to a win after she came from this barrier and finished runner-up here last time out, beaten 1.4 metres. A repeat of that effort could be good enough to win a race of this calibre. HOMEBOUND (10) hasn't been too far away of late and was solid again when she came from a similar barrier for fourth last week. If things go her way she can pose a serious challenge. JOHNNY TANG (7) draws on the back row but must be considered after a brave effort last week, racing three wide without cover but fighting well to go under by a neck as runner-up at Menangle. CHARLENES DELIGHT (2) was solid in fourth after working last start. A lower draw sees her right in contention.",
